    <field_description order="after"><para>The Effective value of PSTATE.UAO is 0 when execution is at EL0.</para>
<para>The Effective value of PSTATE.UAO is 1 when any of the following is true:</para>
<list type="unordered">
<listitem><content>
<para>Execution is at EL1, and <register_link state="AArch64" id="AArch64-hcr_el2.xml">HCR_EL2</register_link>.{NV, NV1} is {1, 1}.</para>
</content>
</listitem><listitem><content>
<para>Execution is at EL2, and the Effective value of HCR_EL2.{E2H, TGE} is not {1, 1}.</para>
</content>
</listitem><listitem><content>
<para>Execution is at EL3.</para>
</content>
</listitem></list></field_description>
